WEBVTT

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:08.580
Shio-chan, does it taste bad?

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:11.650
No, it's good.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:14.820
Really? Good.

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:19.430
Cherry tomatoes are so cute.

00:01:52.640 --> 00:01:57.880
Hey, Satou, you seem a little off today.

00:01:58.570 --> 00:02:01.550
A little, but I'm okay.

00:02:02.490 --> 00:02:04.770
Shio-chan is feeling down.

00:02:06.390 --> 00:02:08.950
It has left me feeling so anxious.

00:02:12.830 --> 00:02:16.860
Satou, your bag looks so sweet!

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:19.010
It's cute!

00:02:20.170 --> 00:02:24.890
Right? I used to be into fake sweets.

00:02:32.140 --> 00:02:33.940
Satou.

00:02:34.460 --> 00:02:37.350
Shoko's taking a day off today.

00:02:37.350 --> 00:02:40.190
It's our first time working together,
just the two of us.

00:02:40.190 --> 00:02:42.350
Yeah.
Let's do a good job, Su-chan.

00:02:42.350 --> 00:02:43.610
Okay.

00:02:47.070 --> 00:02:49.440
Let's work hard, okay?

00:02:51.330 --> 00:02:52.840
Yeah.

00:02:52.840 --> 00:02:55.330
That's right! I have to work hard.

00:02:55.330 --> 00:02:56.570
Welcome!

00:02:57.080 --> 00:02:59.710
Because I have a dream.

00:02:59.710 --> 00:03:01.410
Thank you very much!

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:05.370
Oh, I know! I should make a rice omelet today.

00:03:05.370 --> 00:03:07.430
Shio-chan loves that.

00:03:09.970 --> 00:03:11.370
What are you doing?

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:14.710
Man, now I'm all wet. How are you going to fix this?

00:03:16.140 --> 00:03:18.940
Pretty sure it was your fault.

00:03:18.940 --> 00:03:20.130
Bring me the manager!

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:21.830
Well--

00:03:21.830 --> 00:03:23.470
Master!

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:26.110
I'm terribly sorry about that.

00:03:26.110 --> 00:03:27.890
Are you hurt at all?

00:03:29.310 --> 00:03:31.290
Excuse me.

00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:34.440
I'll clean it right up.

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:36.160
It's okay.

00:03:36.160 --> 00:03:37.920
By the way, sir...

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:40.750
This is a non-smoking establishment.

00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:42.200
Oh, is it?

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:43.990
Sorry!

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:48.910
No problem. Thank you for your understanding!

00:03:50.010 --> 00:03:52.330
Satou, you're amazing.

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:57.960
You're super pretty, and you can handle any situation.

00:03:58.770 --> 00:04:01.190
I wish I could be as perfect as you.

00:04:02.770 --> 00:04:05.320
I'm not that perfect.

00:04:06.180 --> 00:04:10.140
I made a mistake the other day
and things turned out really bad.

00:04:10.420 --> 00:04:14.310
Right. I almost lost what's important to me.

00:04:15.450 --> 00:04:18.400
So, I'm not going to make the same mistake again.

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:22.360
I'm going to face everything with all I've got.

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:24.570
Then you really are amazing!

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:30.450
Satou, I've always admired you.

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:33.600
Ever since we first talked at work,

00:04:33.600 --> 00:04:35.930
I've never stopped watching you.

00:04:35.930 --> 00:04:40.730
I always wondered why you're so amazing,
and what you're made of.

00:04:40.730 --> 00:04:45.400
Hey, Satou, how were you made?

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:53.490
What is it, Mitori?

00:04:53.490 --> 00:04:55.400
Satou's house?

00:04:56.160 --> 00:05:00.870
She's popular. She's had a few stalkers before.

00:05:00.870 --> 00:05:04.740
She may just not want people knowing her address.

00:05:05.540 --> 00:05:09.670
Yes. I've been there once before.

00:05:09.670 --> 00:05:14.790
But, no one answered when I rang the doorbell.

00:05:15.390 --> 00:05:18.190
Even though it seemed like someone was home.

00:05:23.310 --> 00:05:28.600
So you were the one who opened my locker
and looked inside.

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:34.370
I've always hated myself.

00:05:34.370 --> 00:05:36.450
I'm so plain and clumsy.

00:05:36.450 --> 00:05:39.460
Nothing ever goes right in my life.

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:43.650
That's why I want to be like you, Satou!

00:05:45.920 --> 00:05:48.340
I went through a lot for this bag!

00:05:48.340 --> 00:05:51.470
I looked for the same things you had
and bought them.

00:05:51.470 --> 00:05:53.750
What I couldn't find, I made myself.

00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:57.080
I'm even using the same makeup.

00:05:57.080 --> 00:06:00.130
I copied the way you wear it too.

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:06.760
I work the same shifts, and I have the same handkerchief, socks and underwear.

00:06:08.010 --> 00:06:10.430
But it's still not enough.

00:06:10.940 --> 00:06:13.760
I can't go to the same school as you.

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:15.240
And our hairstyles...

00:06:15.240 --> 00:06:17.850
My hair is still too short.

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:21.480
And I don't know what my dream is.

00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:25.580
So I thought I'd at least try to have
the same home environment as you.

00:06:25.580 --> 00:06:28.110
That's why I read through your résumé.

00:06:29.090 --> 00:06:34.180
But, it looks like no one lives at the address you wrote.

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:39.290
Satou, are you keeping where you live a secret?

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:41.460
Won't you tell me?

00:06:44.560 --> 00:06:48.380
-If you're not hiding anything, you can tell me, right?
-Satou-chan...

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:53.260
-I want to know everything about you!
-Satou-chan...

00:06:53.260 --> 00:06:54.890
Because I love you!

00:06:54.890 --> 00:06:56.810
This is also love.

00:06:56.810 --> 00:06:58.480
Shut up!

00:06:58.480 --> 00:06:59.910
-Satou.
-Satou-chan...

00:06:59.910 --> 00:07:01.870
-Shut up!
-I won't tell a soul.

00:07:01.870 --> 00:07:03.870
-Satou-chan...
-Shut up!

00:07:03.870 --> 00:07:05.250
-Satou!
-Satou-chan...

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:06.650
It's so bitter...

00:07:07.170 --> 00:07:08.440
Shut up.

00:07:09.920 --> 00:07:11.160
Shut up!

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:26.650
Satou--

00:07:43.690 --> 00:07:47.480
Su-chan, your fingers are so thin and cute.

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:49.290
You're so small and skinny.

00:07:49.290 --> 00:07:51.610
You feel so soft when I hug you.

00:07:52.380 --> 00:07:56.200
It's because you're you that I love you.

00:07:58.130 --> 00:08:01.180
Love? No way! There's no way!

00:08:01.180 --> 00:08:03.930
There's no way you'd love me!

00:08:03.930 --> 00:08:07.640
Why not? I think it's cute how you say that too.

00:08:07.640 --> 00:08:10.050
No way! I--

00:08:10.050 --> 00:08:11.810
I'm no good, and I'm defiant.

00:08:11.810 --> 00:08:15.370
There's no way someone would love me.

00:08:15.370 --> 00:08:19.970
That's why I'm going to try hard
to be just like you!

00:08:20.820 --> 00:08:24.750
I won't be able to love you if you do that.

00:08:25.230 --> 00:08:29.190
You're wonderful the way you are right now, Su-chan.

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:34.160
The way you were born.
You don't have to try hard to be anything.

00:08:34.430 --> 00:08:36.930
You don't ever have to grow up.

00:08:36.930 --> 00:08:41.220
Even if you're not so sharp,
you're fine the way you are.

00:08:42.090 --> 00:08:45.350
I'll be the only one who loves you.

00:08:48.680 --> 00:08:51.570
You're so unfair, Satou.

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:53.500
I can't...

00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:57.010
I can't say no to something
that makes me so happy!

00:09:01.240 --> 00:09:03.230
I surprised you, didn't I?

00:09:03.230 --> 00:09:05.410
It's okay.

00:09:06.740 --> 00:09:08.650
Satou!

00:09:11.530 --> 00:09:13.610
But, Su-chan...

00:09:13.610 --> 00:09:17.220
Don't ever pry into my life ever again.

00:09:19.010 --> 00:09:21.620
I'm kind of mad.

00:09:24.390 --> 00:09:25.670
I'm sorry.

00:09:25.670 --> 00:09:28.360
Don't hate me!

00:09:28.360 --> 00:09:30.960
I'll do anything you tell me to!

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:35.050
This is also love, Satou-chan.

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:36.830
Auntie.

00:09:36.830 --> 00:09:39.030
Your words...

00:09:39.030 --> 00:09:41.160
still echo within me.

00:09:55.630 --> 00:09:57.160
It's still bitter.

00:09:57.160 --> 00:09:59.660
It's because I told such a dirty lie.

00:10:00.300 --> 00:10:02.070
I can't leave things like this.

00:10:02.070 --> 00:10:04.120
Or else I'll...

00:10:09.060 --> 00:10:10.210
Shio-chan!

00:10:14.560 --> 00:10:15.810
Shio-chan!

00:10:15.810 --> 00:10:17.260
I want something sweet!

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:20.220
Shio-chan! Where are you? Shio-chan!

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:22.450
Or else I'll...

00:10:24.070 --> 00:10:25.410
Shio-chan?

00:10:33.710 --> 00:10:35.030
Shio-chan...

00:10:42.090 --> 00:10:43.950
So is this...

00:10:44.170 --> 00:10:46.300
Mitsuboshi's house?

00:10:49.140 --> 00:10:50.290
Taiyo?

00:10:50.510 --> 00:10:54.210
Your friend from work is here to visit you.

00:10:55.270 --> 00:10:58.060
Oh, it sounds like he's in the bathroom.

00:10:58.060 --> 00:10:59.980
Can you wait a little?

00:10:59.980 --> 00:11:01.690
I'll make some tea.

00:11:01.690 --> 00:11:02.990
Sure.

00:11:04.490 --> 00:11:06.870
His mom seems really nice.

00:11:10.080 --> 00:11:11.770
I wish I had been born

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:13.940
into a family like this too.

00:11:32.100 --> 00:11:33.270
Taiyo?

00:11:33.270 --> 00:11:34.750
I'm okay, Mom!

00:11:37.940 --> 00:11:40.010
We're going to talk in my room...

00:11:40.520 --> 00:11:42.470
so you stay downstairs.

00:11:45.570 --> 00:11:48.920
Hey. What's "family"?

00:11:48.920 --> 00:11:51.890
Like my mom and my dad?

00:11:51.890 --> 00:11:56.120
The people I care about who are always with me?

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:03.780
Spinning... Spinning...

00:12:05.920 --> 00:12:07.450
Hey. Look at this!

00:12:07.670 --> 00:12:11.540
Shio, I told you not to go outside!

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:14.680
S-- Sorry...

00:12:16.310 --> 00:12:18.190
Spinning...

00:12:18.190 --> 00:12:21.400
I'm so lonely I can't move.

00:12:21.400 --> 00:12:23.790
I can't breathe.

00:12:23.790 --> 00:12:27.110
Is this "family"?

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:31.540
Shio-chan! Shio-chan, hang in there!

00:12:32.410 --> 00:12:35.320
Shio-chan, does it hurt?
Are you in pain?

00:12:35.320 --> 00:12:36.650
Punishment...

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:38.960
This is my punishment.

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:42.410
Satou-chan, I'm sorry.

00:12:42.410 --> 00:12:45.340
I lied to you.

00:12:46.130 --> 00:12:47.630
Lied?

00:12:47.630 --> 00:12:49.300
I...

00:12:49.300 --> 00:12:51.590
talked to someone else...

00:12:51.590 --> 00:12:54.580
just a little bit that one night.

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:59.250
So God must be angry at me.

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:02.830
Because I betrayed you.

00:13:02.830 --> 00:13:04.060
Shio-chan!

00:13:04.060 --> 00:13:07.680
I did something wrong again.

00:13:09.240 --> 00:13:10.730
I...

00:13:10.730 --> 00:13:13.060
I have to say something! But...

00:13:13.910 --> 00:13:15.410
It's bitter...

00:13:15.410 --> 00:13:18.980
It's bitter! It's bitter! It's bitter!

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:21.040
I can't think straight.

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:23.830
Why is this so...?

00:13:23.830 --> 00:13:26.140
Why...?

00:13:26.140 --> 00:13:27.490
Punishment.

00:13:28.460 --> 00:13:31.010
Is this my punishment?

00:13:31.510 --> 00:13:33.120
But punishment for what?

00:13:34.590 --> 00:13:37.310
Is it because I did something wrong?

00:13:37.310 --> 00:13:38.940
I don't know why!

00:13:50.240 --> 00:13:52.130
You came to visit me?

00:13:52.130 --> 00:13:55.770
Thank you.
I'm sorry I didn't call you earlier.

00:13:56.700 --> 00:13:59.930
-No problem.
-Sorry my room's a mess.

00:13:59.930 --> 00:14:01.110
No problem.

00:14:01.910 --> 00:14:05.450
Can you look out the window for a bit?
I'll clean up.

00:14:06.290 --> 00:14:07.460
Okay.

00:14:15.340 --> 00:14:19.500
Don't step on my angel!

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:21.500
What is this guy talking about?

00:14:21.720 --> 00:14:24.400
Who is that girl?

00:14:27.110 --> 00:14:28.610
An angel.

00:14:29.860 --> 00:14:34.070
She's the angel who purified me.

00:14:34.820 --> 00:14:40.770
I received divine punishment that day
because I tried to keep her to myself.

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:45.390
What can my filthy self do in order to see her again?

00:14:45.390 --> 00:14:47.750
How can I become pure?

00:14:48.250 --> 00:14:52.530
I thought about it,
but I couldn't think of anything except her.

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:56.430
When I'm surrounded by her like this,

00:14:56.430 --> 00:14:58.190
I feel like...

00:14:58.190 --> 00:15:01.270
I'm becoming clean.

00:15:02.270 --> 00:15:05.050
Taiyo! There, there!

00:15:05.050 --> 00:15:07.020
There, there!

00:15:08.560 --> 00:15:10.470
I don't get what you're saying.

00:15:10.680 --> 00:15:14.310
S-- Sorry, Mitsuboshi!
I'm going home!

00:15:14.550 --> 00:15:17.640
If you're quitting, just let us know. That's all.

00:15:18.490 --> 00:15:20.940
Has Matsuzaka been coming to work?

00:15:24.450 --> 00:15:27.020
Does Matsuzaka have any family?

00:15:27.020 --> 00:15:28.950
Does she live with her parents?

00:15:28.950 --> 00:15:32.870
-I heard she lives alone with her aunt.
-Really?

00:15:33.550 --> 00:15:35.910
Does she really live alone with her aunt?

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:39.910
I saw her.

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:42.850
I saw her take this girl with her.

00:15:45.140 --> 00:15:48.590
Maybe Matsuzaka kidnapped this girl.

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:53.810
If that's the case, we can't forgive her, right?

00:15:53.810 --> 00:15:57.570
Matsuzaka is doing something unforgivable.

00:16:00.160 --> 00:16:04.920
I've done whatever it took
to protect my life with Shio-chan.

00:16:04.920 --> 00:16:08.460
I thought it was okay to do anything

00:16:08.460 --> 00:16:10.740
if it was for my one and only love.

00:16:10.740 --> 00:16:12.840
But that wasn't true.

00:16:12.840 --> 00:16:15.970
I had it wrong.

00:16:16.550 --> 00:16:17.910
Satou-chan...

00:16:18.160 --> 00:16:20.730
Is this your love?

00:16:20.730 --> 00:16:22.720
Does it hurt this much?

00:16:22.720 --> 00:16:24.170
And make you nauseous?

00:16:24.170 --> 00:16:26.520
And make you keep crying?

00:16:27.090 --> 00:16:29.510
Is this the one and only love...

00:16:29.510 --> 00:16:32.050
you've been searching for all along?

00:16:40.230 --> 00:16:44.650
What are you saying?
Satou would never do something like that!

00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:48.650
What reason would Satou have to kidnap someone?

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:51.730
Obviously...

00:16:51.730 --> 00:16:55.300
it's so she can keep the angel all to herself!

00:16:55.960 --> 00:16:57.450
Hida!

00:16:57.730 --> 00:16:59.310
Help me!

00:16:59.310 --> 00:17:01.580
Help me get her back!

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:03.680
-Let go of me!
-I beg you!

00:17:03.680 --> 00:17:06.390
She might be hurting her!

00:17:06.390 --> 00:17:09.210
-Stop it!
-She might be crying! I have to save her!

00:17:09.430 --> 00:17:11.190
-With my own hands!
-That hurts!

00:17:11.190 --> 00:17:14.760
-I'm sure that'd make her smile at--!
-I said, stop it!

00:17:17.030 --> 00:17:19.780
-H--Hida!
-Don't touch me, you idiot!

00:17:19.780 --> 00:17:20.930
You idiot!

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:31.440
Idiot! Idiot! Idiot! What's his problem?
You disgusting idiot! Even though you're hot!

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:45.370
Shio Koube

00:17:45.690 --> 00:17:47.390
What is this?

00:17:48.640 --> 00:17:51.860
What's going on? Satou!

00:17:55.590 --> 00:17:58.090
Shio-chan, I'm sorry.

00:17:58.090 --> 00:18:00.420
I committed a crime too.

00:18:00.420 --> 00:18:03.520
Did you do something bad too?

00:18:04.320 --> 00:18:06.880
I'm going to tell you everything.

00:18:06.880 --> 00:18:08.920
My crime...

00:18:08.920 --> 00:18:12.170
I...

00:18:16.110 --> 00:18:18.150
My voice is gone.

00:18:18.150 --> 00:18:20.340
Can I really say this? It's just...

00:18:20.340 --> 00:18:25.330
If she finds out what I did...
What if Shio-chan starts to hate me?

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:33.270
I might lose her.

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:36.900
My one and only love!

00:18:37.730 --> 00:18:40.280
Satou-chan! Satou-chan!

00:18:40.280 --> 00:18:42.180
Satou-chan!

00:18:46.490 --> 00:18:48.080
I'm scared.

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:50.620
I can't look into Shio-chan's eyes.

00:18:52.870 --> 00:18:54.420
That's right.

00:18:54.960 --> 00:18:56.600
If I lie...

00:18:56.600 --> 00:18:59.010
If I pretend, so that no one finds out...

00:19:01.920 --> 00:19:03.400
No.

00:19:03.400 --> 00:19:05.200
I have to confess my crime.

00:19:05.720 --> 00:19:07.410
Or else this bitter punishment

00:19:08.010 --> 00:19:10.420
will never go away!

00:19:16.270 --> 00:19:17.730
You know...

00:19:17.730 --> 00:19:19.360
Shio-chan...

00:19:22.690 --> 00:19:24.260
Please...

00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:25.490
Don't...

00:19:25.490 --> 00:19:26.680
abandon me!

00:19:26.680 --> 00:19:28.100
I...

00:19:28.990 --> 00:19:33.370
told someone else that I love them.

00:19:34.160 --> 00:19:36.170
Even though I promised you...

00:19:37.490 --> 00:19:41.040
I promised that...

00:19:41.040 --> 00:19:43.010
I'd love you forever!

00:19:43.010 --> 00:19:47.830
Lie or not,
I told someone else that I love them!

00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:50.000
I betrayed my love for you.

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:52.420
I betrayed my promise!

00:19:52.690 --> 00:19:55.940
Sorry, Shio-chan! I'm sorry!

00:19:55.940 --> 00:19:59.460
You're the one I love the most!

00:19:59.460 --> 00:20:02.050
So much that I don't need anything else.

00:20:03.070 --> 00:20:05.720
You're the guiding light for my love.

00:20:05.720 --> 00:20:08.370
My one and only...

00:20:08.370 --> 00:20:09.990
My...

00:20:15.610 --> 00:20:18.160
Satou-chan, there, there.

00:20:18.160 --> 00:20:19.840
Don't cry.

00:20:21.500 --> 00:20:22.670
You know...

00:20:23.200 --> 00:20:26.370
I love you too, Satou-chan.

00:20:28.420 --> 00:20:29.940
Shio-chan...

00:20:29.940 --> 00:20:32.970
You'll forgive me?

00:20:35.220 --> 00:20:37.230
I know...

00:20:37.230 --> 00:20:41.590
that you work hard for me.

00:20:41.590 --> 00:20:44.010
So it's okay.

00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:46.930
It's okay because it's you!

00:20:50.660 --> 00:20:52.270
Shio-chan...

00:20:52.480 --> 00:20:53.690
What?

00:20:54.740 --> 00:20:56.610
I love you.

00:20:57.160 --> 00:20:58.940
Me too!

00:20:59.460 --> 00:21:01.960
I love you more than anything and anyone

00:21:01.960 --> 00:21:05.070
and even more than my family!

00:21:05.070 --> 00:21:09.800
You're warmer and happier than my family!

00:21:11.760 --> 00:21:13.120
It's sweet!

00:21:14.430 --> 00:21:19.300
-Satou-chan, I'm sorry I lied too--
-It doesn't matter!

00:21:19.300 --> 00:21:22.070
Thank you, Shio-chan.

00:21:25.640 --> 00:21:27.240
Satou-chan!

00:21:37.330 --> 00:21:41.150
Through happiness and sadness,

00:21:41.150 --> 00:21:43.440
until death do us part,

00:21:43.660 --> 00:21:48.340
I promise to love you, Satou-chan.

00:21:49.910 --> 00:21:51.550
Even if it's for love,

00:21:52.970 --> 00:21:55.850
it's wrong to deceive the people we love.

00:21:57.310 --> 00:21:59.960
It's wrong to lie about love.

00:22:01.020 --> 00:22:02.360
So...

00:22:03.480 --> 00:22:07.100
there's no need for me to tell Shio-chan about that.

00:22:07.100 --> 00:22:08.600
Because...

00:22:09.280 --> 00:22:12.740
Because it's not a crime.

00:22:15.520 --> 00:22:18.120
Right, God?

00:22:18.690 --> 00:22:21.190
I'll never let it cloud up again.

00:22:21.190 --> 00:22:24.480
My dear, precious...

00:22:24.480 --> 00:22:26.800
happy sugar life!

00:24:01.300 --> 00:24:04.100
Satou would never kidnap anyone.

00:24:04.640 --> 00:24:05.850
Never.

00:24:05.850 --> 00:24:07.770
Mitsuboshi is crazy.

00:24:12.940 --> 00:24:15.440
It looked like the devil to me.

00:24:15.440 --> 00:24:18.640
It looked like a monster to me.

00:24:18.640 --> 00:24:21.480
Because it was too kind.
Because it was too scary.

00:24:21.480 --> 00:24:22.740
6th Life:

00:24:22.740 --> 00:24:26.210
"We Revolve Around the Moon."
